-- title:
--   Reachability and axis-specific invalidation seeds
-- statement:
--   For an arbitrary node type and directed edge relation, defines reflexive-transitive Reach by a reflexive constructor and extension by one edge; edge a b is read as b depending directly on a. Impacted holds when some changed seed reaches the node. A ChangeAt record pairs a node with a contract Delta. SemanticSeed, ReplaySeed and NoveltySeed select changes whose corresponding Boolean invalidation field is true; the three axis-specific Impacted predicates propagate their seeds by Reach. An empty change list supplies no seeds; the graph need not be finite or acyclic.
